[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11288.71, "timestamp": "03:08:08", "text": "和卡鲁。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11313.19, "timestamp": "03:08:33", "text": "好的。好的。我告诉你。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11315.429, "timestamp": "03:08:35", "text": "基本上理解的意思就像是“是的，你”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11317.11, "timestamp": "03:08:37", "text": "我听懂了对方说的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11320.07, "timestamp": "03:08:40", "text": "东西和wakaru或wakaru是编号"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11323.11, "timestamp": "03:08:43", "text": "这句话。明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11336.15, "timestamp": "03:08:56", "text": "我懂了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11339.03, "timestamp": "03:08:59", "text": "嗯，我喜欢你的态度。"}]